","vocabularyIds":["u8.cold","u8.outside"]},{"content":{"locale":"en-US","maxSeconds":12,"referenceText":"I wear a coat."},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"I wear a coat.\". Cũng đúng: \"A coat.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["I wear a coat.","A coat."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"Gợi ý trả lời: \"Tôi mặc áo khoác.\"","id":"u8n7l1-e08","nonSpeechAlternative":{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"No, it is easy."},{"id":"c2","text":"It is Monday."},{"id":"c3","text":"I wear a coat."}]},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"I wear a coat.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Gợi ý trả lời: \"Tôi mặc áo khoác.\"","id":"u8n7l1-e08a","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"\"What do you wear in winter?\" — chọn câu trả lời phù hợp"},"skillIds":["speaking","u8.dialogue"],"type":"choice","vocabularyIds":["u8.winter","u8.wear","u8.coat"]},"prompt":{"audioAssetId":"a.u8.d6.n","locale":"en-US","text":"What do you wear in winter?"},"skillIds":["speaking","u8.dialogue"],"type":"dialogueTurn","vocabularyIds":["u8.winter","u8.wear","u8.coat"]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"Rainy"},{"id":"c2","text":"Sunny"},{"id":"c3","text":"Cold"}],"passage":"In Canada, Tom wears a coat in winter. It is very cold and there is snow. In Ho Chi Minh City, it is always hot. Today it is sunny in the morning. Tom does not take an umbrella. In the afternoon, the sky is cloudy and it starts to rain. Tom is outside! Mai has an umbrella. \"Here, Tom. Vietnam has two seasons: the dry season and the rainy season. Now it is the rainy season!\" Tom laughs. \"I love the weather here. It is never cold!\"","question":"How is the weather in the morning?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"Sunny\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c2","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Tom và mùa mưa\".","id":"u8n7l1-e09